{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 18,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then answered Bildad the Shuhite, and said,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How long ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "will it be ere",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ye make an end of words? mark, and afterwards we will speak.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Why are we counted as beasts, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " reputed vile in your sight?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He teareth himself in his anger: shall the earth be forsaken for thee? and shall the rock be removed out of its place?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yes, the light of the wicked shall be put out, and the spark of his fire shall not shine.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The light shall be dark in his tabernacle, and his candle shall be put out with him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The steps of his strength shall be straitened, and his own counsel shall cast him down.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he is cast into a net by his own feet, and he walketh upon a snare.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The gin shall take ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " by the heel, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the robber shall prevail against him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The snare ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " laid for him in the ground, and a trap for him in the way.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Terrors shall make him afraid on every side, and shall drive him to his feet.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "His strength shall be hunger-bitten, and destruction ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ready at his side.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It shall devour the strength of his skin: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the first-born of death shall devour his strength.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "His confidence shall be rooted out of his tabernacle, and it shall bring him to the king of terrors.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It shall dwell in his tabernacle, because ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " none of his: brimstone shall be scattered upon his habitation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "His roots shall be dried up beneath, and above shall his branch be cut off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "His remembrance shall perish from the earth, and he shall have no name in the street.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He shall be driven from light into darkness, and chased out of the world.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He shall neither have son nor nephew among his people, nor any remaining in his dwellings.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They that come after ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shall be astonished at his day, as they that went before were affrighted.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.18.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.18.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely such ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the dwellings of the wicked, and this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the place ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of him that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " knoweth not God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
